                                                "sense_id": "7881d537-40e0-312c-9279-1afe770d485b",
                                                "text": "I am convinced that this book is not solely of interest to Japanophiles. The quality of Sado Hasegawa's work shines through and the book should prove to be a valued asset to any home library and is beautiful for display."
